<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title>Welcome to <%= agencyName %> - Teepas</title>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style type="text/css">
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        min-width: 100%;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.5;
        background-color: #fafafa;
        color: #222222;
      }

      a {
        color: #0070f3;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      p {
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      .email-wrapper {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .email-header {
        background-color: #0070f3;
        padding: 24px;
        color: #ffffff;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .email-body {
        padding: 24px;
        background-color: #ffffff;
      }

      .email-footer {
        background-color: #f6f6f6;
        padding: 24px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #0070f3;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-align: center;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }

      .highlight {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #0070f3;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
      <div class="email-header">
        <h1>Welcome to <%= agencyName %> 🎉</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="email-body">
        <p>Hello <%= agentName %>,</p>

        <p>
          Congratulations! You’ve successfully joined
          <span class="highlight"><%= agencyName %></span> as an agent on
          <strong>Teepas</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
          Your account has been created and linked to the agency. You can now
          log in to manage your listings, connect with clients, and collaborate
          with your agency team.
        </p>

        <p style="text-align: center;">
          <a href="<%= dashboardLink %>" class="button">Go to Dashboard</a>
        </p>

        <p>
          Welcome aboard — we’re excited to have you on the team! If you have
          any questions, feel free to reach out to your agency admin
          (<span class="highlight"><%= inviterName %></span>) or contact our
          support team below.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="email-footer">
        <p>
          Need help? Contact
          <a href="mailto:support@teepas.com">support@teepas.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
